{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Short Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Tower of Shadows</i> is a tactical turn-based game where each floor of a mysterious tower is a unique challenge. In a dark, atmospheric world, the player climbs floor after floor to confront the Master of Shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different: enemy compositions, rewards, rooms, and events are procedurally generated, offering strong replayability. The game demands strategy, adaptation, and perseverance \u2014 players will fail, retry, and grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classics like <i>Heroes of Might and Magic</i>, <i>The Tower of Shadows</i> blends exploration, tactical combat, and progression with a competitive scoring system for players seeking mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udde1 Tactical Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic, top\u2011down battles requiring planning and adaptation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of spells, units, and synergies to master</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0 A Tower Full of Trials</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 full biomes + final boss floor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around <strong>1h30 per biome</strong>, offering a substantial adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural generation ensures every run feels fresh</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcda Deep Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90+ spells</strong> in the Hero Spellbook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35+ hero equipment items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ unique items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 recruitable units</strong> + <strong>2 champions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25 enemies</strong> + <strong>4 bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC vendor, loot variety, evolving bestiary</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd01 High Replayability</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural rooms, enemies, and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring system for competitive players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenging experience designed to be replayed many times</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Full Localization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text: FR / EN / DE / RU</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio: FR &amp; EN</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematics included</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Corridors of the Dungeon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/b5c6b7c630c498e8c75761fc25797723ff270a8b.jpg"},{"name":"The Warehouse ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/39baa0175fd1f85f1a9bd9962d740669d4ba4f85.jpg"},{"name":"Wine cellar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/ddeccb559f9c8e76c8c45c8746919e2af5b222ac.jpg"},{"name":"The tavern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/fcb2d3da08ff8ecc7a79211d7a805b7de7bdffac.jpg"},{"name":"The Neighborhoods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/0176867b0a4c1dca675887549d3af55d0477cd6f.jpg"},{"name":"The Statues of the Ancients","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/a71c50250df0a2bb863eb33ed801a5d514cb21b3.jpg"},{"name":"The forge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3767720/4b40f909a51bba251ba62ee471b71f9f89e61fba.jpg"}